DESCRIPTION:Jonathan is trying not to make a mess\, but someone has put a 
 subway station in his apartment!\nTo figure out what's going on\, Jonathan
  goes to City Hall and discovers something about the City Hall computer th
 at just might help him fix his problem.\nJoin us for a storytime with the 
 Robert Munsch story\nJonathan Cleaned Up…Then He Heard a Sound\nand a sc
 reening of the animated version from the National Film Board\,\nBlackberry
  Subway Jam\n. Drop-in.
