 ycled cardboard that can safely and efficiently move your toy from a start
 ing point to a finish line. The transporter must be both sturdy and creati
 ve. Create a car\, train\, bike\, plane\, or something completely new! Aft
 er\, we will take it apart to be reused for future programs.\nFor school-a
 ged children and their caregivers.\nDrop-in. No registration required.\nMa
 kedo is a series of safe cardboard construction tools purposely designed f
 or kids to imagine and build the world they want to see.
